5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I worry about us not speaking after this. Let's pick something that keeps the peace.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I just want a corner we can walk past without holding our breath in August.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need to know the actual hours this will take from our lives.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,Why does one house always get the bin? That feels unfair to me.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,We must look at the costs. Who pays for the setup and the upkeep?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, you're right. Fairness matters. But we also need to be able to talk.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, I agree. A quiet solution is best. I hope we find one.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, costs are part of the hours. If it's expensive, it's a burden.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, hours are good, but who does the work? That's the real cost.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Asuka, @Rin, both are true. We need the full picture before deciding.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,Let's look at the complaint log. It might show who is most affected.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I'd like to see the station block's minutes. Maybe they solved this.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will check the supervised mornings on the next lane. It seems practical.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,I want the measurements of the frontages. We need to know the space.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will look at the ward subsidy and the block ledger. Money is key.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Kenji,,Okay. Let's see what we find. I hope it helps us stay friends.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"Thank you, everyone. I trust we will find a gentle path forward.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"I will be precise. We need data, not guesses. Let's proceed.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Rin,,This is going to be fun! I can't wait to see the numbers.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,Wisdom comes from looking closely. Let us see what the facts reveal.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
